    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cronin Wall Properties are proud to offer for sale this detached family home which extends to approx. 125 sq m set on mature landscaped gardens with stunning countryside views. This home, set on a generous site of circa. 0.11 hectares will appeal to any growing family who wish to experience country living yet close to all amenities. This property is within a five minute drive to all the local facilities such as Shops, Church, Sporting Facilities, Community Centre, National School, Secondary Schools. An opportunity not to be missed, viewings are highly recommended.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of: Ground Floor - Entrance Hallway, Living Room, Kitchen, Back Porch, Dining Room, Bedroom 1, Bathroom. \r\nFirst Floor - Bedroom 2, Bedroom 3, Bedroom 4, Bathroom Outside - Detached Garage\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway 1.88 X 1.86 \r\nWood effect flooring, light fitting, radiator \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room 4.36 X 3.64 \r\nCarpet flooring, light fitting, curtains & poles, built in shelving unit, solid fuel burning inset stove with granite surround, radiators\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen 3.30 X 4.85 \r\nVinyl flooring, solid oak kitchen units, tiled splashback, electric cooker, cooker hood, washing machine, fridge/freezer, light fitting, curtains & pole\r\n\r\n\r\nBack Porch 1.33 X 1.90 \r\nVinyl flooring, light fitting \r\n\r\n\r\nDining Room 4.55 X 3.67 \r\nCarpet flooring, light fitting, radiator, curtains & pole \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1. 3.96 X 2.86 \r\nCarpet flooring, curtains & pole, fitted wardrobes, light fitting, radiator \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom 1.91 X 2.33 \r\nTiled flooring, w.h.b. with vanity unit, mirror with storage, w.c, bath with tiled surround, electric shower, light fitting\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2. 3.34 X 4.89 \r\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, light fitting, radiator, blinds, curtains & pole\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3. 2.36 X 4.34 \r\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, light fitting, curtains & pole \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4. 3.34 X 2.62m \r\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, light fitting, radiator, curtains & pole\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom 1.59 X 1.70 \r\nTiled flooring, w.h.b, w.c, shower, blinds, light fitting \r\n\r\n\r\nDetached Garage \r\nPower points throughout"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Detached family home extending to approximately 125 sq. m. (1,345 sq. ft.)\r\nSituated on a generous site of circa 0.11 hectares (0.27 acres)\r\nMature landscaped gardens offering excellent privacy and outdoor space\r\nStunning countryside views\r\nDetached garage providing additional storage or workshop potential\r\nLocated within a five-minute drive of local amenities\r\nConvenient access to both national and secondary schools\r\nWell-maintained grounds with ample parking"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D"
      }
